{"id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-logical-consequence.md","title":"Logical Consequence","display":"df-logical-consequence — Logical Consequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-logical-consequence","aliases":["92-df-logical-consequence"],"display":"df-logical-consequence — Logical Consequence","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-logical-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-logical-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-consequence — Logical Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\Phi \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>的逻辑后承</li>\n<li>在所有满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>的结构中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>也成立</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi = \\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\Phi = \\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G) \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G) \\models \\varphi\\)</span>即<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的公理模型中真</li>\n<li>对采用标准可靠一阶演算的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\models_G\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\models_G\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>对采用标准完备一阶演算并把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>作为非逻辑公理的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，一阶完备性给出反向蕴涵；这里的“完备性”是演算相对于所有模型的完备性</li>\n<li>算术不完备比较的是特定理论的可证性与标准模型真理，不与一阶逻辑的语义后承完备性冲突</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","locat